## What Yoru relies on but does not bundle

Yoru drives the player's own installation of these separate projects. None of
them is included in this repository or in a Yoru release, and each carries its
own licence and its own authors' credit.

- **RetroArch** — Yoru is its own libretro frontend and never launches or
  bundles RetroArch, but when an installation is present it reuses that
  installation's mGBA core, BIOS folder and core options.
  <https://www.retroarch.com/>
- **mGBA libretro core** — the emulator core that actually executes the game.
  <https://mgba.io/>
- **pokeemerald** — the Pokémon Emerald decompilation, used as the reference
  for Generation III save format and engine behaviour.
  <https://github.com/pret/pokeemerald>

